ith no real child or provider contact, including one planted shared/preloaded-module movement case. Feature packets implement only their leaf modules and never rewrite the predecessor registry, dispatcher, help, CLI or child boundary. Git and GitHub state are not authority." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
